# Fambord Frontend - Windsurf Rules

## Project Context
- React 19 SPA with Vite 7
- TanStack Router for file-based typesafe routing
- TanStack Query for server-state management
- Shadcn/UI (Radix primitives) for components
- TailwindCSS 4 for styling
- Axios for HTTP via custom apiClient wrapper
- Zod + React Hook Form for form validation
- Lucide React for icons
- TypeScript strict mode enabled

## Code Style
- Use `@/` path alias for all imports (maps to `src/`)
- Single quotes, 2-space indent, trailing commas (see .prettierrc)
- Functional components only, no class components
- Use arrow functions for component definitions in features
- Use named exports for components, default export only for pages/app

## Project Structure
```
src/
├── api/              # Global API client, endpoints, shared API utilities
├── common/           # Shared UI components, hooks, utils, layout, theme
│   ├── ui/           # Shadcn/UI components organized by category
│   ├── hooks/        # Shared custom hooks
│   ├── layout/       # App layout components
│   ├── theme/        # Theme provider and hooks
│   ├── error/        # Error boundary and error pages
│   └── utils/        # Shared utility functions
├── features/         # Feature modules (domain-driven)
│   └── [feature]/
│       ├── api/      # Feature-specific API functions
│       ├── components/ # Feature-specific components
│       ├── hooks/    # Feature-specific hooks (queries, mutations)
